    "handle": "makimoo-embossed-cushion-covers-set-of-2-soft-breathable-b0gjldmt57",
    "description": "Soft and Skin Friendly Fabric: Made from 100 percent microfiber, these cushion covers offer a smooth, gentle feel against the skin. The embossed surface adds subtle texture and a refined look while staying breathable for everyday comfort. Envelope Closure for a Clean Look: Each cover features a hidden envelope closure that keeps the insert securely tucked inside and makes changing or removing fillings quick and easy, with no exposed zippers to snag or scratch. Two Covers in a Versatile Size: The set includes two cushion covers measuring 50 x 70cm, fitting standard pillows and shams on sofas, beds, armchairs and lounge seating to refresh your space in minutes. Easy Care and Lasting Color: Machine washable and tumble dry friendly, these covers keep their shape, dry quickly and require no ironing. The light grey color resists fading for a neat appearance wash after wash. Simple Style for Any Room: The neutral light grey tone and understated embossed pattern blend effortlessly with modern, minimalist and classic décor, making these covers a practical choice for living rooms, bedrooms and guest spaces.",
