    "description": "Complete 4-Piece Set: Includes four matching outdoor chair cushions sized 110 x 55cm, perfect for refreshing your patio dining set, garden chairs, or balcony seating area with a cohesive floral bird look. Generous Dimensions & Supportive Comfort: Each cushion measures 110 x 55cm to deliver full back and seat coverage; the thick padded fill provides a soft yet supportive seat for long afternoons outdoors. Secure Tie Attachments: Integrated sturdy fabric ties at the top and sides make it easy to fasten each cushion to your chairs, helping keep pads neatly in place during breezy days and regular use. Durable Weather-Resistant Fabric: Crafted from 100% polyester with a printed floral bird pattern on a neutral beige base, the material resists everyday outdoor wear, fading, and light moisture for lasting seasonal use. Versatile Styling & Easy Maintenance: The elegant botanical design complements wood, metal, and wicker furniture alike; simply spot clean or hand wash as needed to keep the cushions looking fresh.",
