    "description": "Luxurious Long-Staple Cotton: Woven from quality long-staple cotton fibers, these towels feel exceptionally soft against skin and provide a cozy, spa-like wrap after every bath or shower. Generous 80 x 140cm Coverage: Each towel is sized to drape comfortably around adults, offering ample surface area for quick, effective drying at home, the gym, or while traveling. Dense 32-Ply Absorbency: The thick cotton construction quickly pulls moisture away from your body and hair, helping you stay comfortably dry without excessive rubbing. Built to Last: Reinforced double-stitched hems resist fraying and help the towels maintain their shape, color, and plush feel through regular washing and daily use. Matching 2-Piece Set in Classic Blue: This set includes two coordinated bath towels in a versatile blue tone that blends easily with modern, traditional, or hotel-style bathroom décor.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>Luxurious Long-Staple Cotton: Woven from quality long-staple cotton fibers, these towels feel exceptionally soft against skin and provide a cozy, spa-like wrap after every bath or shower.</p><p>Generous 80 x 140cm Coverage: Each towel is sized to drape comfortably around adults, offering ample surface area for quick, effective drying at home, the gym, or while traveling.</p><p>Dense 32-Ply Absorbency: The thick cotton construction quickly pulls moisture away from your body and hair, helping you stay comfortably dry without excessive rubbing.</p><p>Built to Last: Reinforced double-stitched hems resist fraying and help the towels maintain their shape, color, and plush feel through regular washing and daily use.</p><p>Matching 2-Piece Set in Classic Blue: This set includes two coordinated bath towels in a versatile blue tone that blends easily with modern, traditional, or hotel-style bathroom décor.</p>",
