    "handle": "luxury-faux-rabbit-fur-plush-blanket-for-couch-sofa-and-bed-1688-969627065032-c33",
    "description": "Luxuriously Soft Faux Rabbit Fur: Crafted from high-pile faux rabbit fur with carved channel stripes, this blanket offers a silky, cloud-like feel that invites you to relax on the couch or in bed. Package Includes: The set contains 1 blanket measuring 200 x 180cm, providing generous coverage for two people or as a full decorative layer across your bed or sofa. Warm Yet Lightweight: Thick plush fibers trap body heat while remaining breathable, delivering cozy warmth during cool evenings without feeling heavy or restrictive. Versatile Home Accent: The sophisticated dark gray tone and elegant ribbed texture complement bedroom and living room décor; use it as a throw, bed blanket, nap cover, or cozy reading companion. Simple Care for Lasting Softness: Reinforced edges help maintain the plush texture wash after wash; machine wash cold on a gentle cycle and tumble dry low to keep it fresh and fluffy.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>Luxuriously Soft Faux Rabbit Fur: Crafted from high-pile faux rabbit fur with carved channel stripes, this blanket offers a silky, cloud-like feel that invites you to relax on the couch or in bed.</p><p>Package Includes: The set contains 1 blanket measuring 200 x 180cm, providing generous coverage for two people or as a full decorative layer across your bed or sofa.</p><p>Warm Yet Lightweight: Thick plush fibers trap body heat while remaining breathable, delivering cozy warmth during cool evenings without feeling heavy or restrictive.</p><p>Versatile Home Accent: The sophisticated dark gray tone and elegant ribbed texture complement bedroom and living room décor; use it as a throw, bed blanket, nap cover, or cozy reading companion.</p><p>Simple Care for Lasting Softness: Reinforced edges help maintain the plush texture wash after wash; machine wash cold on a gentle cycle and tumble dry low to keep it fresh and fluffy.</p>",
