    "descriptionHtml": "<p>Luxuriously Soft Faux Rabbit Fur: Crafted from high-pile faux rabbit fur with carved channel stripes, this blanket offers a silky, cloud-like feel that invites you to relax on the couch or in bed.</p><p>Package Includes: The set contains 1 blanket measuring 230 x 200cm, providing generous coverage for two people or as a full decorative layer across your bed or sofa.</p><p>Warm Yet Lightweight: Thick plush fibers trap body heat while remaining breathable, delivering cozy warmth during cool evenings without feeling heavy or restrictive.</p><p>Versatile Home Accent: The calming blue tone and elegant ribbed texture complement bedroom and living room décor; use it as a throw, bed blanket, nap cover, or cozy reading companion.</p><p>Simple Care for Lasting Softness: Reinforced edges help maintain the plush texture wash after wash; machine wash cold on a gentle cycle and tumble dry low to keep it fresh and fluffy.</p>",
