    "description": "SOFT CLOUD YARN FABRIC: This duvet cover is woven from a brushed cotton blend that feels light, airy and gentle against the skin, bringing a soft cloud like touch to your bed. The smooth surface drapes neatly over your quilt and helps keep the filling in place, so your bed looks tidy from morning to night. ROMANTIC DOUBLE LACE TRIM: Wide scalloped lace borders run along the edges and the pillow opening, adding a delicate vintage touch that pairs beautifully with the sweet cherry print. Small stitched lines above the lace keep the trim flat and even, so the ruffled edge holds its shape after repeated use and washing. SWEET CHERRY PRINT IN SOFT PINK: Tiny cherries and scattered blossoms are printed on a pale pink ground, creating a fresh, cheerful look that suits bedrooms, guest rooms and dorm rooms. The print is evenly distributed across the fabric, so the pattern stays visible whether the duvet cover is spread flat or folded back. WHAT YOU RECEIVE: Duvet Cover x 1: 230 x 200 cm. Please check the size of your quilt before ordering and measure your bed to confirm the fit. The cover uses a hidden zipper closure along the bottom edge, which keeps the opening neat and makes it simple to slide your quilt inside. EASY CARE AND EVERYDAY USE: Turn the duvet cover inside out before washing, machine wash in cold water on a gentle cycle and tumble dry on low or hang it to dry in the shade. Light shaking after drying helps release wrinkles and restore the soft, fluffy feel of the fabric for the next night of rest.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>SOFT CLOUD YARN FABRIC: This duvet cover is woven from a brushed cotton blend that feels light, airy and gentle against the skin, bringing a soft cloud like touch to your bed. The smooth surface drapes neatly over your quilt and helps keep the filling in place, so your bed looks tidy from morning to night.</p><p>ROMANTIC DOUBLE LACE TRIM: Wide scalloped lace borders run along the edges and the pillow opening, adding a delicate vintage touch that pairs beautifully with the sweet cherry print. Small stitched lines above the lace keep the trim flat and even, so the ruffled edge holds its shape after repeated use and washing.</p><p>SWEET CHERRY PRINT IN SOFT PINK: Tiny cherries and scattered blossoms are printed on a pale pink ground, creating a fresh, cheerful look that suits bedrooms, guest rooms and dorm rooms. The print is evenly distributed across the fabric, so the pattern stays visible whether the duvet cover is spread flat or folded back.</p><p>WHAT YOU RECEIVE: Duvet Cover x 1: 230 x 200 cm. Please check the size of your quilt before ordering and measure your bed to confirm the fit. The cover uses a hidden zipper closure along the bottom edge, which keeps the opening neat and makes it simple to slide your quilt inside.</p><p>EASY CARE AND EVERYDAY USE: Turn the duvet cover inside out before washing, machine wash in cold water on a gentle cycle and tumble dry on low or hang it to dry in the shade. Light shaking after drying helps release wrinkles and restore the soft, fluffy feel of the fabric for the next night of rest.</p>",
