    "handle": "makimoo-king-size-duvet-cover-set-3-pieces-ultra-soft-duvset-white-king",
    "description": "Premium Brushed Microfiber: Woven from ultra-soft brushed microfiber, this duvet cover set delivers a smooth, gentle touch against the skin and helps create a cozy, breathable sleep environment you can enjoy night after night. Secure Zipper Closure and Corner Ties: A hidden zipper closure allows for quick duvet insertion and removal, while the interior corner ties hold your comforter firmly in place to reduce shifting, bunching, and daily adjustments. Complete 3-Piece King Set: Each package includes 1 duvet cover measuring 104 x 90 in and 2 pillowcases measuring 20 x 36 in, giving you a coordinated bedding refresh in one convenient set. Lightweight Year-Round Comfort: The breathable microfiber construction encourages airflow to help regulate warmth, making this duvet cover set a comfortable choice for use throughout every season. Easy Care and Lasting Freshness: Machine washable for simple upkeep, this duvet cover set resists wrinkles and fading to help maintain a clean, inviting bed with minimal effort.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>Premium Brushed Microfiber: Woven from ultra-soft brushed microfiber, this duvet cover set delivers a smooth, gentle touch against the skin and helps create a cozy, breathable sleep environment you can enjoy night after night.</p><p>Secure Zipper Closure and Corner Ties: A hidden zipper closure allows for quick duvet insertion and removal, while the interior corner ties hold your comforter firmly in place to reduce shifting, bunching, and daily adjustments.</p><p>Complete 3-Piece King Set: Each package includes 1 duvet cover measuring 104 x 90 in and 2 pillowcases measuring 20 x 36 in, giving you a coordinated bedding refresh in one convenient set.</p><p>Lightweight Year-Round Comfort: The breathable microfiber construction encourages airflow to help regulate warmth, making this duvet cover set a comfortable choice for use throughout every season.</p><p>Easy Care and Lasting Freshness: Machine washable for simple upkeep, this duvet cover set resists wrinkles and fading to help maintain a clean, inviting bed with minimal effort.</p>",
