    "id": "makimoo-BEDSET4-LILAC-TWIN",
    "asin": "BEDSET4-LILAC-TWIN",
    "title": "Makimoo 4 Piece Bedding Set With Duvet Cover Fitted Sheet And 2 Pillowcases Soft Cozy Breathable Microfiber Ditsy Floral Print Farmhouse Bedroom Decor Twin (Purple Grey)",
    "handle": "makimoo-4-piece-bedding-set-with-duvet-cover-fitted-sheet-bedset4-lilac-twin",
    "description": "COMPLETE 4 PIECE SET: This bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (68 x 88 in), 1 fitted sheet (39 x 75 in), and 2 pillowcases (20 x 26 in). All pieces coordinate together to give your bed a polished, matching look. SOFT AND BREATHABLE FABRIC: Made from soft microfiber, this bedding set feels smooth and gentle against the skin. The breathable fabric helps keep you comfortable while you sleep, making it a cozy choice for your bedroom. CHARMING DITSY FLORAL DESIGN: The purple grey ditsy floral print brings a delicate, vintage-inspired look to your space. This cute pattern adds a warm and inviting touch that complements farmhouse, cottage, and modern bedroom styles. SNUG FITTED SHEET: The fitted sheet is designed with all-around elastic to help it stay securely in place on your mattress. Its smooth surface pairs with the matching duvet cover and pillowcases for a coordinated bedding look. EASY CARE AND MAINTENANCE: This bedding set is machine washable for simple upkeep. Wash in cold water on a gentle cycle and tumble dry low as needed to keep the fabric soft and the colors looking fresh.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>COMPLETE 4 PIECE SET: This bedding set includes 1 duvet cover (68 x 88 in), 1 fitted sheet (39 x 75 in), and 2 pillowcases (20 x 26 in). All pieces coordinate together to give your bed a polished, matching look.</p><p>SOFT AND BREATHABLE FABRIC: Made from soft microfiber, this bedding set feels smooth and gentle against the skin. The breathable fabric helps keep you comfortable while you sleep, making it a cozy choice for your bedroom.</p><p>CHARMING DITSY FLORAL DESIGN: The purple grey ditsy floral print brings a delicate, vintage-inspired look to your space. This cute pattern adds a warm and inviting touch that complements farmhouse, cottage, and modern bedroom styles.</p><p>SNUG FITTED SHEET: The fitted sheet is designed with all-around elastic to help it stay securely in place on your mattress. Its smooth surface pairs with the matching duvet cover and pillowcases for a coordinated bedding look.</p><p>EASY CARE AND MAINTENANCE: This bedding set is machine washable for simple upkeep. Wash in cold water on a gentle cycle and tumble dry low as needed to keep the fabric soft and the colors looking fresh.</p>",
