    "description": "4 PIECE BEDDING SET: This coordinated set includes 1 duvet cover (104 x 90 in), 1 fitted sheet (78 x 80 in), and 2 pillowcases (20 x 36 in) for a complete King size bed setup. BOTANICAL FLORAL PRINT: The grey green small floral pattern brings a calm botanical look to the bedroom. It pairs easily with light wood furniture, neutral walls, and soft throws for a cozy, inviting space. SOFT AND BREATHABLE FABRIC: The fabric feels smooth and gentle against the skin, while the breathable construction helps keep the bed comfortable through the night. The duvet cover and pillowcases offer a soft touch for lounging or sleeping. FITTED SHEET STAYS IN PLACE: The fitted sheet is designed to wrap around the mattress and help keep the bedding neat and tidy. Its smooth surface works with the matching duvet cover and pillowcases for a unified look. EASY TO STYLE AND MAINTAIN: The set is simple to coordinate and easy to refresh. The floral design hides everyday creases while adding a subtle pattern, making it a practical choice for guest rooms, master bedrooms, or everyday use.",
