    "description": "COMPLETE 4 PIECE BEDDING SET: This coordinated set includes 1 duvet cover (80 x 88 in), 1 fitted sheet (54 x 75 in), and 2 pillowcases (20 x 26 in each), so you can refresh your bed with a matching floral lace look. ROMANTIC FLORAL LACE DETAIL: A soft pink purple floral print is paired with delicate lace trim, bringing a gentle shabby chic and farmhouse cottage charm to your bedroom. SOFT AND BREATHABLE COMFORT: The smooth fabric feels gentle against the skin, and the breathable design helps create a cozy, comfortable sleep environment. PRACTICAL FITTED SHEET: The fitted sheet features an elastic edge to help keep it securely in place on your mattress, while the duvet cover and pillowcases complete the coordinated bedding ensemble. EASY STYLE AND CARE: The pastel floral pattern blends easily with many bedroom decors, and the set is simple to maintain with regular gentle washing.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>COMPLETE 4 PIECE BEDDING SET: This coordinated set includes 1 duvet cover (80 x 88 in), 1 fitted sheet (54 x 75 in), and 2 pillowcases (20 x 26 in each), so you can refresh your bed with a matching floral lace look.</p><p>ROMANTIC FLORAL LACE DETAIL: A soft pink purple floral print is paired with delicate lace trim, bringing a gentle shabby chic and farmhouse cottage charm to your bedroom.</p><p>SOFT AND BREATHABLE COMFORT: The smooth fabric feels gentle against the skin, and the breathable design helps create a cozy, comfortable sleep environment.</p><p>PRACTICAL FITTED SHEET: The fitted sheet features an elastic edge to help keep it securely in place on your mattress, while the duvet cover and pillowcases complete the coordinated bedding ensemble.</p><p>EASY STYLE AND CARE: The pastel floral pattern blends easily with many bedroom decors, and the set is simple to maintain with regular gentle washing.</p>",
