    "handle": "makimoo-4-piece-king-bedding-set-patchwork-block-print-bedset4-coffee-king",
    "description": "COMPLETE 4 PIECE BEDDING SET: This coordinated set includes everything needed to refresh a bed in one go, featuring 1 duvet cover at 104 x 90 in, 1 fitted sheet at 78 x 80 in, and 2 matching pillowcases at 20 x 36 in, so the whole bed is dressed in one consistent look. PATCHWORK BLOCK PRINT DESIGN: The duvet cover and pillow shams share an eye catching patchwork layout of botanical block prints, arranged in repeating square panels with hand drawn style florals in warm brown, olive green and soft grey tones for a relaxed boho farmhouse feel. SOFT BREATHABLE FABRIC: Woven from smooth microfiber that feels gentle against the skin, the fabric is lightweight yet substantial enough to drape nicely over the bed, helping to keep you comfortable through warm and cool seasons alike. SECURE FIT AND SIMPLE CARE: The fitted sheet wraps the mattress with an elasticized edge for a neat, stay put finish, while the duvet cover closes securely to keep the insert in place; simply machine wash cold on a gentle cycle and tumble dry low for easy upkeep. VERSATILE NEUTRAL STYLING: The earthy patchwork palette pairs effortlessly with light wood furniture, woven rugs and linen curtains, making this set a thoughtful housewarming, wedding or holiday gift for anyone who loves cozy, layered bedroom decor.",
