    "description": "BREATHABLE LINEN FABRIC: This duvet cover set is made from linen fabric with a naturally textured surface that feels soft and breathable. The material helps regulate temperature for comfortable use across seasons, while the relaxed woven look brings a calm, organic touch to your bedroom. 3 PIECE SET WITH DIMENSIONS: Each set includes Duvet Cover x 1: 80 x 90 in and Pillowcase x 2: 20 x 26 in. The duvet cover is designed for Full size beds, and the pillowcases coordinate with the matching charcoal grey finish. Please note duvet insert is not included. SECURE CORNER TIES AND BUTTON CLOSURE: The duvet cover features corner ties to help hold your insert in place, while the button closure keeps the opening neatly covered. This thoughtful construction makes it easier to refresh your bedding and maintain a tidy look. EASY CARE AND LONG LASTING TEXTURE: Machine wash cold with like colors, then tumble dry low or line dry. The linen fabric is made to handle regular washing and becomes softer over time while keeping its textured charcoal grey appearance. VERSATILE CHARCOAL GREY STYLE: The deep charcoal grey color and natural linen texture suit modern, minimalist, farmhouse, and rustic bedrooms. Use it as a base layer and add throws or pillows to create a cozy, layered look without overpowering your space.",
