    "descriptionHtml": "<p>COMPLETE 3 PIECE BEDDING SET: This set includes 1 duvet cover measuring 80 x 90 in and 2 pillowcases measuring 20 x 26 in, providing a coordinated foundation for a Full size bed. The matching pieces create a clean, layered look without extra shopping.</p><p>100% Linen FABRIC: Woven from linen, this duvet cover set offers a naturally textured surface that feels soft against the skin while remaining breathable. The fabric gains a relaxed, lived-in softness over time.</p><p>BREATHABLE &amp; MOISTURE WICKING: The linen weave helps air circulate and manages moisture through the night, making this set a comfortable choice for warm sleepers and year round use. It helps keep you cool in summer and cozy in cooler months.</p><p>DURABLE &amp; EASY CARE: Reinforced stitching supports everyday use, and the fabric is machine washable for simple upkeep. Wash cold with like colors and tumble dry low to maintain the natural texture.</p><p>VERSATILE OATMEAL STYLE: The oatmeal hue brings a soft, neutral warmth that pairs well with farmhouse, boho, minimalist, and Scandinavian bedrooms. Use it as a base layer and add throws or pillows to refresh the look.</p>",
