    "descriptionHtml": "<p>Premium Linen Fabric: This duvet cover set is made from 100% Linen, offering a breathable, soft, and skin-friendly touch. The natural fibers help regulate temperature, keeping you comfortable in every season.</p><p>3-Piece Set Includes: 1 Duvet Cover (104 x 90 in) and 2 Pillowcases (20 x 36 in). The King size set provides complete bedding coverage with matching pillow shams for a tidy, coordinated look.</p><p>Breathable &amp; Moisture-Wicking: The linen construction promotes air circulation and absorbs moisture, helping you stay cool and dry throughout the night. Ideal for hot sleepers and humid climates.</p><p>Natural Farmhouse Aesthetic: The oatmeal hue and subtle linen texture bring a relaxed, rustic charm to your bedroom. This neutral set blends effortlessly with modern, coastal, or farmhouse decor.</p><p>Easy Care &amp; Long-Lasting: Machine washable for effortless maintenance. The fabric softens with each wash while retaining its strength, and durable stitching supports everyday use.</p>",
