    "title": "Cooling Washed Ice Silk Dual Tone Duvet Cover Reversible Soft Breathable Lightweight Smooth Cozy Machine Washable Bedding For Bedroom Guest Room 220 x 180 cm (Milkshake White)",
    "handle": "cooling-washed-ice-silk-dual-tone-duvet-cover-reversible-1688-1048207560416",
    "description": "COMPLETE PACKAGE: The package includes Duvet Cover x 1: 220 x 180cm, offering a single ready-to-use cover for your bed. COOLING WASHED ICE SILK: The washed ice silk fabric has a smooth, silky-soft surface that feels cool and gentle against the skin, helping you stay comfortable in warmer rooms. DUAL TONE REVERSIBLE STYLE: The dual tone design gives you two complementary looks in one cover. Flip the duvet cover to refresh the look of your bedroom, guest room, or dorm. SOFT BREATHABLE COMFORT: Lightweight and breathable, this duvet cover drapes smoothly over your bed without feeling heavy. The soft texture adds a cozy layer for relaxing and sleeping. EASY CARE AND VERSATILE USE: Machine washable for convenient upkeep, this cooling duvet cover is easy to maintain. It works well as a standalone cover or as a layer over your comforter.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>COMPLETE PACKAGE: The package includes Duvet Cover x 1: 220 x 180cm, offering a single ready-to-use cover for your bed.</p><p>COOLING WASHED ICE SILK: The washed ice silk fabric has a smooth, silky-soft surface that feels cool and gentle against the skin, helping you stay comfortable in warmer rooms.</p><p>DUAL TONE REVERSIBLE STYLE: The dual tone design gives you two complementary looks in one cover. Flip the duvet cover to refresh the look of your bedroom, guest room, or dorm.</p><p>SOFT BREATHABLE COMFORT: Lightweight and breathable, this duvet cover drapes smoothly over your bed without feeling heavy. The soft texture adds a cozy layer for relaxing and sleeping.</p><p>EASY CARE AND VERSATILE USE: Machine washable for convenient upkeep, this cooling duvet cover is easy to maintain. It works well as a standalone cover or as a layer over your comforter.</p>",
