    "handle": "cooling-ice-silk-duvet-cover-silky-breathable-solid-color-1688-1061371343572-c6",
    "description": "COOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: This duvet cover is made of cooling ice silk fabric that feels silky smooth against the skin. The breathable material promotes air circulation and helps wick away moisture, keeping you comfortable on warm nights. COMPLETE SET INCLUDES: This listing includes one duvet cover. Duvet Cover x 1: 200 x 150cm. Please note that other bedding items shown in the images are not included. SILKY SMOOTH & SKIN-FRIENDLY: The ice silk fabric offers a gentle, smooth touch that is kind to your skin. Its lightweight and soft texture allows for a relaxing sleep experience without feeling heavy or clingy. VERSATILE SOLID COLOR DESIGN: The solid champagne tea green color brings a clean and elegant look to your bedroom. This neutral tone easily matches various decor styles, making it suitable for dormitories, guest rooms, and master bedrooms. EASY CARE & DURABLE: The duvet cover is easy to maintain and can be machine washed on a gentle cycle. The fabric retains its softness and color after repeated use, providing long-lasting comfort.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>COOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: This duvet cover is made of cooling ice silk fabric that feels silky smooth against the skin. The breathable material promotes air circulation and helps wick away moisture, keeping you comfortable on warm nights.</p><p>COMPLETE SET INCLUDES: This listing includes one duvet cover. Duvet Cover x 1: 200 x 150cm. Please note that other bedding items shown in the images are not included.</p><p>SILKY SMOOTH &amp; SKIN-FRIENDLY: The ice silk fabric offers a gentle, smooth touch that is kind to your skin. Its lightweight and soft texture allows for a relaxing sleep experience without feeling heavy or clingy.</p><p>VERSATILE SOLID COLOR DESIGN: The solid champagne tea green color brings a clean and elegant look to your bedroom. This neutral tone easily matches various decor styles, making it suitable for dormitories, guest rooms, and master bedrooms.</p><p>EASY CARE &amp; DURABLE: The duvet cover is easy to maintain and can be machine washed on a gentle cycle. The fabric retains its softness and color after repeated use, providing long-lasting comfort.</p>",
