    "asin": "1688-1061371343572-C12",
    "title": "Luxury Soft Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover, Silky Breathable Solid Color Bedding Cover, Smooth Lightweight Comforter Protector for Bedroom Guest Room, 200 x 230 cm (Cream)",
    "handle": "luxury-soft-cooling-ice-silk-duvet-cover-silky-breathable-1688-1061371343572-c12",
    "description": "WHAT YOU RECEIVE: This set includes 1 x Duvet Cover, measuring 200 x 230cm. The cover is designed to fit your comforter and bring a clean, modern look to your bedroom. Please check your comforter size before ordering. COOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: Made with cooling ice silk fabric, this duvet cover feels cool to the touch and helps create a comfortable sleep environment for hot sleepers. The smooth surface feels gentle against the skin. SILKY SMOOTH AND BREATHABLE: The silky breathable texture allows air to circulate and helps reduce moisture buildup, keeping you comfortable through the night. Its soft drape adds a subtle sheen that elevates your bedding. SOLID COLOR EASY MATCHING: The solid color design offers a versatile, minimalist look that pairs easily with different bedroom styles. The understated tone brings a calm, cozy atmosphere to your space. LIGHTWEIGHT COMFORTER PROTECTOR: This lightweight duvet cover protects your comforter from daily dust and wear while remaining easy to handle. It is simple to remove and put back on, making bedding refresh quick and convenient.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>WHAT YOU RECEIVE: This set includes 1 x Duvet Cover, measuring 200 x 230cm. The cover is designed to fit your comforter and bring a clean, modern look to your bedroom. Please check your comforter size before ordering.</p><p>COOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: Made with cooling ice silk fabric, this duvet cover feels cool to the touch and helps create a comfortable sleep environment for hot sleepers. The smooth surface feels gentle against the skin.</p><p>SILKY SMOOTH AND BREATHABLE: The silky breathable texture allows air to circulate and helps reduce moisture buildup, keeping you comfortable through the night. Its soft drape adds a subtle sheen that elevates your bedding.</p><p>SOLID COLOR EASY MATCHING: The solid color design offers a versatile, minimalist look that pairs easily with different bedroom styles. The understated tone brings a calm, cozy atmosphere to your space.</p><p>LIGHTWEIGHT COMFORTER PROTECTOR: This lightweight duvet cover protects your comforter from daily dust and wear while remaining easy to handle. It is simple to remove and put back on, making bedding refresh quick and convenient.</p>",
