    "title": "Cooling Ice Silk Duvet Cover Silky Breathable Solid Color Bedding Cover Smooth Lightweight Soft Machine Washable Comforter Cover for Bedroom Dorm Hotel 200 x 150 cm (Beige)",
    "handle": "cooling-ice-silk-duvet-cover-silky-breathable-solid-color-1688-1061371343572-c14",
    "description": "COOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: This duvet cover is crafted from cooling ice silk fabric that feels smooth and refreshing against the skin. The breathable weave helps air circulate, creating a comfortable sleep environment without a heavy or clingy feel. SILKY SMOOTH AND BREATHABLE: The silky surface glides over the skin and helps reduce friction for a restful night. Its lightweight, breathable construction makes it a comfortable choice for bedrooms, guest rooms, and dorm rooms. COMPLETE SET INCLUDES: Duvet Cover x 1: 200 x 150 cm. This listing includes the duvet cover only; pillow shams and other bedding accessories are not included. The size is designed to fit a range of comforter inserts. LIGHTWEIGHT AND EASY TO STYLE: The soft, lightweight duvet cover drapes smoothly and is easy to layer with your existing bedding. Its solid color design adds a clean, modern look that complements many bedroom styles. EASY CARE AND VERSATILE USE: Machine wash cold on a gentle cycle and tumble dry low for simple maintenance. The duvet cover is suitable for bedrooms, guest rooms, dorms, and hotel-style bedding setups.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>COOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: This duvet cover is crafted from cooling ice silk fabric that feels smooth and refreshing against the skin. The breathable weave helps air circulate, creating a comfortable sleep environment without a heavy or clingy feel.</p><p>SILKY SMOOTH AND BREATHABLE: The silky surface glides over the skin and helps reduce friction for a restful night. Its lightweight, breathable construction makes it a comfortable choice for bedrooms, guest rooms, and dorm rooms.</p><p>COMPLETE SET INCLUDES: Duvet Cover x 1: 200 x 150 cm. This listing includes the duvet cover only; pillow shams and other bedding accessories are not included. The size is designed to fit a range of comforter inserts.</p><p>LIGHTWEIGHT AND EASY TO STYLE: The soft, lightweight duvet cover drapes smoothly and is easy to layer with your existing bedding. Its solid color design adds a clean, modern look that complements many bedroom styles.</p><p>EASY CARE AND VERSATILE USE: Machine wash cold on a gentle cycle and tumble dry low for simple maintenance. The duvet cover is suitable for bedrooms, guest rooms, dorms, and hotel-style bedding setups.</p>",
