    "handle": "1-piece-cooling-ice-silk-duvet-cover-silky-breathable-solid-1688-1061371343572-c15",
    "description": "Cooling Ice Silk Fabric: Made with ice silk material, this duvet cover offers a smooth, silky surface that feels cool and refreshing against the skin while remaining breathable for restful sleep. Silky Breathable Comfort: The lightweight ice silk weave drapes softly over your comforter and allows air to flow, helping reduce stuffiness and sticky heat for a more comfortable night. Solid Color Home Decor: The peach pink and white solid color design brings a clean, elegant look to bedrooms, dorms, and guest rooms, and coordinates easily with a wide range of sheet and pillow colors. Duvet Cover Included: This listing includes 1 duvet cover measuring 230 x 200cm. Duvet cover only. Comforter insert and pillowcases are not included. Versatile Bedding Layer: Designed as a single duvet cover, it works well for bedroom, dorm, or guest room setups and can be layered with a comforter, quilt, or blanket to suit your sleep preference.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>Cooling Ice Silk Fabric: Made with ice silk material, this duvet cover offers a smooth, silky surface that feels cool and refreshing against the skin while remaining breathable for restful sleep.</p><p>Silky Breathable Comfort: The lightweight ice silk weave drapes softly over your comforter and allows air to flow, helping reduce stuffiness and sticky heat for a more comfortable night.</p><p>Solid Color Home Decor: The peach pink and white solid color design brings a clean, elegant look to bedrooms, dorms, and guest rooms, and coordinates easily with a wide range of sheet and pillow colors.</p><p>Duvet Cover Included: This listing includes 1 duvet cover measuring 230 x 200cm. Duvet cover only. Comforter insert and pillowcases are not included.</p><p>Versatile Bedding Layer: Designed as a single duvet cover, it works well for bedroom, dorm, or guest room setups and can be layered with a comforter, quilt, or blanket to suit your sleep preference.</p>",
