    "handle": "luxury-ice-silk-duvet-cover-cooling-silky-breathable-solid-1688-1061371343572-c16",
    "description": "Cooling Ice Silk Fabric: Crafted from cooling ice silk fabric, this duvet cover helps create a refreshing sleep environment for hot sleepers. The smooth surface feels cool to the touch and brings a gentle, breathable feel to your bed. Silky Smooth and Breathable: The silky breathable weave allows air to flow through, while the soft finish glides over the skin. It drapes neatly over your comforter and adds a smooth, comfortable touch. Component and Dimensions: Duvet Cover x 1: 220 x 180cm. This listing includes the duvet cover shown, with the size listed above for easy reference before purchase. Solid Color Elegant Look: The peach pink and white palette offers a soft, clean look that fits dorm rooms, guest rooms, and modern bedrooms. The solid color design pairs easily with different bedding for a calm, coordinated bed. Lightweight and Easy to Store: The lightweight design folds compactly for simple storage and quick bedding changes. It is a practical choice for everyday use and makes a thoughtful addition to your sleep space.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>Cooling Ice Silk Fabric: Crafted from cooling ice silk fabric, this duvet cover helps create a refreshing sleep environment for hot sleepers. The smooth surface feels cool to the touch and brings a gentle, breathable feel to your bed.</p><p>Silky Smooth and Breathable: The silky breathable weave allows air to flow through, while the soft finish glides over the skin. It drapes neatly over your comforter and adds a smooth, comfortable touch.</p><p>Component and Dimensions: Duvet Cover x 1: 220 x 180cm. This listing includes the duvet cover shown, with the size listed above for easy reference before purchase.</p><p>Solid Color Elegant Look: The peach pink and white palette offers a soft, clean look that fits dorm rooms, guest rooms, and modern bedrooms. The solid color design pairs easily with different bedding for a calm, coordinated bed.</p><p>Lightweight and Easy to Store: The lightweight design folds compactly for simple storage and quick bedding changes. It is a practical choice for everyday use and makes a thoughtful addition to your sleep space.</p>",
