    "handle": "cooling-ice-silk-duvet-cover-smooth-breathable-silky-solid-1688-1061371343572-c17",
    "description": "COOLING ICE SILK TOUCH: The fabric surface feels noticeably cool and silky the moment it meets your skin, helping you stay comfortable through warm, stuffy nights and wake up feeling refreshed instead of overheated. SMOOTH AND BREATHABLE: A lightweight weave lets air move freely through the cover, while the fine silky texture glides gently over the body for a soft, skin friendly feel that stays pleasant all night long. REFRESHING PEACH PINK AND WHITE: The soft peach pink tone balanced with clean white creates a calm, elegant look that brightens the bedroom and blends easily with light wood, white, or pastel decor styles. PACKAGE CONTENTS: This listing includes 1 duvet cover measuring 200 x 150cm. The size is clearly noted so you can compare it with your quilt before making the bed, and the smooth finish slips on easily. EASY CARE AND LASTING SOFTNESS: Machine washable on a gentle cycle for simple everyday upkeep, and the fabric keeps its silky hand feel and fresh color when washed and dried with regular care.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>COOLING ICE SILK TOUCH: The fabric surface feels noticeably cool and silky the moment it meets your skin, helping you stay comfortable through warm, stuffy nights and wake up feeling refreshed instead of overheated.</p><p>SMOOTH AND BREATHABLE: A lightweight weave lets air move freely through the cover, while the fine silky texture glides gently over the body for a soft, skin friendly feel that stays pleasant all night long.</p><p>REFRESHING PEACH PINK AND WHITE: The soft peach pink tone balanced with clean white creates a calm, elegant look that brightens the bedroom and blends easily with light wood, white, or pastel decor styles.</p><p>PACKAGE CONTENTS: This listing includes 1 duvet cover measuring 200 x 150cm. The size is clearly noted so you can compare it with your quilt before making the bed, and the smooth finish slips on easily.</p><p>EASY CARE AND LASTING SOFTNESS: Machine washable on a gentle cycle for simple everyday upkeep, and the fabric keeps its silky hand feel and fresh color when washed and dried with regular care.</p>",
