    "descriptionHtml": "<p>PACKAGE INCLUDES: 1 Duvet Cover: 220 x 180cm. This listing includes the duvet cover only; other items shown in the image are not included.</p><p>COOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: The cooling ice silk fabric offers a refreshing touch, helping to reduce the feeling of heat and stickiness during warm nights. Silky and smooth, it glides over the skin for a comfortable sleep.</p><p>BREATHABLE AND SILKY SMOOTH: Breathable construction allows air to flow, while the silky surface feels soft and gentle. Lightweight and smooth, it is suitable for hot sleepers and warm climates.</p><p>SOLID COLOR DESIGN: The solid color design in White Peach Taro Purple creates a clean, modern aesthetic. This versatile style pairs easily with various bedroom decors and bedding sets.</p><p>LIGHTWEIGHT AND EASY TO USE: Lightweight and foldable, this duvet cover is simple to store and handle. Suitable for dormitories, bedrooms, guest rooms, and travel, it is a practical bedding choice.</p>",
