    "description": "COOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: Made with cooling ice silk fabric, this duvet cover offers a refreshing, silky touch that helps reduce the feeling of stuffiness for hot sleepers. The smooth surface glides against the skin and creates a comfortable sleep environment without heavy weight. SILKY SMOOTH AND BREATHABLE: The breathable weave allows air to circulate, while the silky smooth texture feels gentle and soft against the skin. It is designed to provide a light, airy feel that helps you stay comfortable through the night. SIMPLE SOLID COLOR DESIGN: The solid color finish in soft white peach purple tones brings a clean, modern look to bedrooms, dorms, guest rooms, and more. Its understated style pairs easily with different sheet sets and room decor. COMPONENT DETAILS: This item includes one duvet cover, listed as Duvet Cover x 1: 200 x 150cm. The single-piece design makes it simple to coordinate with your existing bedding and easy to use on its own. LIGHTWEIGHT AND EASY CARE: The lightweight construction makes this duvet cover easy to fold and store when not in use. For care, simply follow the care label and wash as needed to keep it clean and ready for use.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>COOLING ICE SILK FABRIC: Made with cooling ice silk fabric, this duvet cover offers a refreshing, silky touch that helps reduce the feeling of stuffiness for hot sleepers. The smooth surface glides against the skin and creates a comfortable sleep environment without heavy weight.</p><p>SILKY SMOOTH AND BREATHABLE: The breathable weave allows air to circulate, while the silky smooth texture feels gentle and soft against the skin. It is designed to provide a light, airy feel that helps you stay comfortable through the night.</p><p>SIMPLE SOLID COLOR DESIGN: The solid color finish in soft white peach purple tones brings a clean, modern look to bedrooms, dorms, guest rooms, and more. Its understated style pairs easily with different sheet sets and room decor.</p><p>COMPONENT DETAILS: This item includes one duvet cover, listed as Duvet Cover x 1: 200 x 150cm. The single-piece design makes it simple to coordinate with your existing bedding and easy to use on its own.</p><p>LIGHTWEIGHT AND EASY CARE: The lightweight construction makes this duvet cover easy to fold and store when not in use. For care, simply follow the care label and wash as needed to keep it clean and ready for use.</p>",
