    "handle": "korean-style-double-lace-duvet-cover-soft-cotton-like-cloud-1688-1051650740507-c3",
    "description": "SOFT CLOUD LIKE FABRIC: Crafted with cotton like cloud soft yarn, this duvet cover offers a gentle and plush feel for a cozy bed. The smooth surface is comfortable to touch and layers well with blankets and pillows. KOREAN DOUBLE LACE DESIGN: The duvet cover features double lace trim along the edges, bringing a romantic and elegant look. The delicate lace detail adds a soft, feminine touch to bedroom decor. SWEET CHERRY PRINT: A fresh cherry pattern is scattered across a light pink background for a sweet and playful style. The cherry and floral motifs make this duvet cover a charming focal point in a girls bedroom, dorm room, or guest room. PACKAGE COMPONENTS: Duvet Cover x 1: 200 x 150cm. This listing includes the duvet cover in the listed size, so you can check your bed dimensions and coordinate with your preferred pillows and blankets. ROMANTIC BEDROOM ACCENT: The lace edges, cherry print, and soft pink tone come together to brighten the room. This duvet cover pairs well with white furniture, sheer curtains, and plush decorative pillows for a cozy, styled space.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>SOFT CLOUD LIKE FABRIC: Crafted with cotton like cloud soft yarn, this duvet cover offers a gentle and plush feel for a cozy bed. The smooth surface is comfortable to touch and layers well with blankets and pillows.</p><p>KOREAN DOUBLE LACE DESIGN: The duvet cover features double lace trim along the edges, bringing a romantic and elegant look. The delicate lace detail adds a soft, feminine touch to bedroom decor.</p><p>SWEET CHERRY PRINT: A fresh cherry pattern is scattered across a light pink background for a sweet and playful style. The cherry and floral motifs make this duvet cover a charming focal point in a girls bedroom, dorm room, or guest room.</p><p>PACKAGE COMPONENTS: Duvet Cover x 1: 200 x 150cm. This listing includes the duvet cover in the listed size, so you can check your bed dimensions and coordinate with your preferred pillows and blankets.</p><p>ROMANTIC BEDROOM ACCENT: The lace edges, cherry print, and soft pink tone come together to brighten the room. This duvet cover pairs well with white furniture, sheer curtains, and plush decorative pillows for a cozy, styled space.</p>",
