    "id": "makimoo-1688-1048207560416-C2",
    "asin": "1688-1048207560416-C2",
    "title": "Cooling Washed Ice Silk Dual-Tone Quilt Cover Soft Breathable Skin-Friendly Lightweight Smooth Bedding For Comfortable Sleep And Cozy Bedroom Decor 150 x 200 cm (Cream Green)",
    "handle": "cooling-washed-ice-silk-dual-tone-quilt-cover-soft-1688-1048207560416-c2",
    "description": "Cooling Ice Silk Comfort: The quilt cover is made with washed ice silk fabric that feels smooth and cool to the touch. Its lightweight, breathable construction helps reduce stuffiness and supports a comfortable sleep environment. The soft surface is gentle on skin and suitable for relaxing rest. Dual-Tone Reversible Style: The dual-tone design pairs a soft green side with a creamy side, so you can switch the look to match your bedroom decor. The elegant color combination adds a calm, modern touch to your bedding and works well with many interior styles. What You Get: The component included is Quilt Cover x 1: 200 x 150cm. Please check the size before use to ensure it fits your bed setup. This single component makes it easy to coordinate with your existing pillows and sheets. Soft Washed Texture: The washed finish gives the fabric a soft, flexible hand feel that drapes neatly over the bed. The smooth surface minimizes friction and feels comfortable against skin. It is a thoughtful choice for those who prefer lightweight bedding with a silky touch. Easy Care and Everyday Use: The quilt cover can be washed as needed and is simple to maintain for regular use. Its lightweight design makes it easy to fold, store, and refresh. Use it as a standalone cover or coordinate it with other bedding pieces for a clean, layered look.",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>Cooling Ice Silk Comfort: The quilt cover is made with washed ice silk fabric that feels smooth and cool to the touch. Its lightweight, breathable construction helps reduce stuffiness and supports a comfortable sleep environment. The soft surface is gentle on skin and suitable for relaxing rest.</p><p>Dual-Tone Reversible Style: The dual-tone design pairs a soft green side with a creamy side, so you can switch the look to match your bedroom decor. The elegant color combination adds a calm, modern touch to your bedding and works well with many interior styles.</p><p>What You Get: The component included is Quilt Cover x 1: 200 x 150cm. Please check the size before use to ensure it fits your bed setup. This single component makes it easy to coordinate with your existing pillows and sheets.</p><p>Soft Washed Texture: The washed finish gives the fabric a soft, flexible hand feel that drapes neatly over the bed. The smooth surface minimizes friction and feels comfortable against skin. It is a thoughtful choice for those who prefer lightweight bedding with a silky touch.</p><p>Easy Care and Everyday Use: The quilt cover can be washed as needed and is simple to maintain for regular use. Its lightweight design makes it easy to fold, store, and refresh. Use it as a standalone cover or coordinate it with other bedding pieces for a clean, layered look.</p>",
